r: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem online atrav\u00e9s da plataforma Lap2Go at\u00e9 \u00e0s 23h59 do dia 20 de novembro de 2026.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"2\u00aa Corrida dos Milagres 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-29\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Madeira, Aveiro\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Madeira\", \"addressRegion\": \"Aveiro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A 2\u00aa Corrida dos Milagres realiza-se a 29 de novembro de 2026 em S\u00e3o Jo\u00e3o da Madeira. Percursos de 10 km e 5 km no Parque dos Milagres. Inscreve-te j\u00e1 oficial!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-corrida-dos-milagres-1.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida dos Milagres 10 km\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/corrida-milagres-2026\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada dos Milagres 5 km\", \"price\": \"5.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/lap2go.com\/pt\/event\/corrida-milagres-2026\"}]}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza a 2\u00aa Corrida dos Milagres 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no 